      "url": "https://library.thechicagoschool.edu/c.php?g=1260402&p=9238271",
      "summary": "This page is part of a guide on research data management provided by The Chicago School Library. It offers detailed information on metadata, metadata standards, data documentation, readme files, and data dictionaries. The page highlights the importance of metadata in contextualizing data and facilitating data discovery, usage, exchange, and preservation. It also provides examples of metadata standards and best practices for data documentation to ensure data is interpretable and useful. Additionally, the guide covers the components and importance of data dictionaries in databases and software programs.",
